---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = '21 June 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms governing your use of the RecConnect website."
  eventBar={false}
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-navy pt-36 pb-14 md:pt-44 md:pb-20 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-72 h-[26rem] bg-primary/[0.06] rotate-12 pointer-events-none" style="clip-path: polygon(20% 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0 100%);"></div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
      <p class="kicker text-primary text-[0.8rem] mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-display uppercase text-white text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[0.95] mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <section class="bg-white py-14 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 legal">
      <p class="lead">
        These terms govern your use of the RecConnect website. By accessing or using this site, you
        agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>About us</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by RecConnect, Briar Cottage, School Lane, Sevenoaks, Kent, TN15 0BE.
        References to "we", "us", and "our" mean RecConnect. References to "you" and "your" mean the
        person accessing the website.
      </p>

      <h2>Using the website</h2>
      <p>
        You may use this website for lawful purposes only. You agree not to use the site in any way
        that breaches any applicable law, is fraudulent or harmful, or that interferes with the proper
        functioning, security, or availability of the site. We may suspend, withdraw, or restrict
        access to all or part of the website at any time without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Membership, events, and purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Some areas of the site link to third-party platforms, for example Stripe for membership
        payments, Eventbrite for event tickets, and WhatsApp for community access. Any purchase,
        subscription, or registration made through those platforms is subject to that provider's own
        terms and conditions in addition to these terms. We are not responsible for the operation of
        third-party platforms.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Unless otherwise stated, we own or are licensed to use all content on this website, including
        text, graphics, logos, the RecConnect name and brand, and the overall design. You may view and
        print pages for your own personal, non-commercial use. You may not copy, reproduce, republish,
        or distribute any part of the site for commercial purposes without our prior written
        permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
      <p>
        We take care to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date, but we make no
        guarantees that it is complete, current, or error-free. Content is provided for general
        information only and does not constitute professional, legal, financial, or business advice.
        You should not rely on it as the sole basis for any decision.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Where the website links to other sites and resources provided by third parties, those links
        are provided for your information only. We have no control over the contents of those sites and
        accept no responsibility for them or for any loss or damage that may arise from your use of
        them.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, we exclude all implied warranties and conditions
        relating to the website. We will not be liable for any loss or damage, whether in contract,
        tort (including negligence), or otherwise, arising out of or in connection with the use of, or
        inability to use, this website. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits our liability for
        death or personal injury caused by negligence, for fraud, or for any other liability that
        cannot be excluded or limited under English law.
      </p>

      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Your use of the website is also governed by our
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, which explains how we handle your personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may revise these terms at any time by updating this page. Please check this page from time
        to time to take notice of any changes, as they are binding on you.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales, and any disputes will be subject to
        the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
      </p>

      <h2>How to contact us</h2>
      <p>
        RecConnect<br />
        Briar Cottage, School Lane<br />
        Sevenoaks, Kent, TN15 0BE<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:hello@recconnect.co">hello@recconnect.co</a>
      </p>

      <p class="disclaimer">
        These terms are provided as a general template and do not constitute legal advice. We
        recommend having them reviewed by a qualified legal professional before relying on them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal { color: #334155; }
  .legal .lead { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .legal h2 {
    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif !important;
    font-weight: 400 !important;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: #0a0b0f;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.9rem;
  }
  .legal p { line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
  .legal ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; }
  .legal li { line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal a { color: #14b8a6; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .legal a:hover { color: #0f766e; }
  .legal strong { color: #0a0b0f; font-weight: 600; }
  .legal .disclaimer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
